        "TileImage": "$($repository dd4e0a16-7b15-4b32-880d-945adbfe8bb0).Image",
        "Description": "Further intel on Ms. Vetrova has uncovered another one of her side projects that has raised some alarms.\rShe has an apparent fascination with the infamous cell known as &quot;The Saints&quot; and has been looking to build a similar cell of her own to expand her growing empire. The first batch of recruits is undercover with her in the Maldives and have been installed as a backup in case her current plans go south.\rFor reasons that should need no explaining, she cannot be allowed to succeed. \rGood luck, 47.",
